 o All lines can be up to 1024 characters long.

 o All ~ Tilde Codes supported.

 o All Ansi Codes supported.

 o \n = Return.

 o \b = Backspace.

 o \f = Clear Screen.

 o y/n prompts will automaticly have the [y/n] added to the end of the text.

 o !!!! IMPORTANT RULES TO LIVE BY !!!!

   1) If a prompt contains %d or %s, then they MUST be left in the prompt!
   2) The order in which %d,%s are originaly must never be changed!  If there
      there is a %d in front of a %s, then leave it that way!  You can change
      the text in between them, but not the order.
   3) NEVER end a prompt with the '\' key!!  Make sure that is never the case!

   If you disobey either of these 3 simple rules you will have problems!

   !!!! IMPORTANT RULES TO LIVE BY !!!!

